OL,3,GNEWSADeputy PM says devolution to
OL,4,A'greatly benefit' Cornwall
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe deputy prime minister has said
OL,7,FCornwall would be a "great beneficiary"
OL,8,Fof upcoming devolution plans.
OL,10,FOn Thursday, Lucy Powell was questioned
OL,11,Fby a number of BBC local radio stations
OL,12,Facross the country on various topics.
OL,14,FEarlier this month Prime Minister Andy
OL,15,FBurnham said the government would work
OL,16,Fwith Cornwall Council and its six MPs
OL,17,Fon a devolution deal "with or without
OL,18,Fan elected mayor".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
